0-27\"},\n    {\"id\": \"chargefox\", \"name\": \"Chargefox\", \"match\": [\"chargefox\", \"yurika\", \"queensland electric super highway\", \"raa\", \"electric highway tasmania\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": 0.6, \"basis\": \"published\", \"siteReading\": \"forbidden\", \"source\": \"Chargefox: site owners set the price; fast DC is 40–60c per kWh on average (Chargefox). Drivers report $0.60–0.74 at DC sites. Its terms forbid robots and scrapers.\", \"checked\": \"2026-10-27\"},\n    {\"id\": \"ampolAmpCharge\", \"name\": \"Ampol AmpCharge\", \"match\": [\"ampcharge\", \"ampol\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": 0.69, \"basis\": \"estimate\", \"siteReading\": \"unchecked\", \"source\": \"Ampol: prices vary by location, shown in the Ampol app; Open Charge Map listings say $0.60–0.75.\", \"sourceUrl\": \"https://ampcharge.ampol.com.au/policies/ampolcard-with-ev-charging-terms-and-conditions\", \"checked\": \"2026-10-27\"},\n    {\"id\": \"bpPulse\", \"name\": \"BP Pulse\", \"match\": [\"bp pulse\", \"bppulse\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": 0.65, \"basis\": \"estimate\", \"siteReading\": \"blocked\", \"source\": \"bp pulse: pricing may vary between locations, some with peak and off-peak prices (bp pulse FAQs). bp's site refuses automated readers.\", \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.bp.com/en_au/australia/home/products-services/bppulse/faqs.html\", \"checked\": \"2026-10-27\"},\n    {\"id\": \"nrma\", \"name\": \"NRMA\", \"match\": [\"nrma\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": 0.79, \"basis\": \"published\", \"siteReading\": \"allowed\", \"source\": \"NRMA: priced by location, $0.69–0.99 a kWh in the My NRMA app, members 5c less. Its public table of site prices may be read but not copied into an app without NRMA's permission.\", \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.mynrma.com.au/electric-vehicles/charging\", \"checked\": \"2026-10-27\"},\n    {\"id\": \"jolt\", \"name\": \"Jolt\", \"match\": [\"jolt\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": 0.45, \"freeKWhPerDay\": 7, \"basis\": \"estimate\", \"siteReading\": \"forbidden\", \"source\": \"Jolt: 7 kWh free a day at fast chargers, then paid; Open Charge Map listings say $0.40–0.46 after the free 7 kWh. Its terms forbid scraping.\", \"sourceUrl\": \"https://jolt.com.au/fair-use-policy\", \"checked\": \"2026-10-27\"},\n    {\"id\": \"exploren\", \"name\": \"Exploren\", \"match\": [\"exploren\", \"engie\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": null, \"basis\": \"none\", \"siteReading\": \"forbidden\", \"source\": \"Exploren (which took over Engie's DC chargers in 2025): site owners set prices, shown in the Exploren app; third-party trackers range from about $0.30 to $1.04 a kWh, so no typical price is stated. Its terms forbid automated reading.\", \"checked\": \"2026-11-18\"},\n    {\"id\": \"waEvNetwork\", \"name\": \"WA EV Network\", \"match\": [\"wa ev network\", \"wa ev highway\", \"horizon power\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": 0.6, \"basis\": \"published\", \"siteReading\": \"unchecked\", \"source\": \"Horizon Power's pricing page, as returned by search on 18 November 2026 (the page itself refused an automated fetch): DC fast chargers 0.60 a kWh (shown as '0.60c'), AC 0.35, unchanged for 2026/27; $1 a minute idle fee on DC after 10 minutes at full charge. Horizon Power's early network FAQs give $0.60 DC and $0.35 AC.\", \"sourceUrl\": \"https://www.horizonpower.com.au/utilities/pricing/\", \"checked\": \"2026-11-18\"},\n    {\"id\": \"electrona\", \"name\": \"Electrona\", \"match\": [\"electrona\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": null, \"basis\": \"none\", \"siteReading\": \"unchecked\", \"source\": \"Electrona Tasmania: pay by card reader at the charger, no app. PlugShare lists Bicheno DC at $0.65 a kWh, but that is one site, so no typical price is stated.\", \"checked\": \"2026-11-18\"},\n    {\"id\": \"wevolt\", \"name\": \"WeVolt\", \"match\": [\"wevolt\"], \"typicalPerKWh\": null, \"basis\": \"none\", \"siteReading\": \"unchecked\", \"source\": \"WeVolt: third-party trackers give differing ranges (35–73c a kWh), so no typical price is stated.\", \"checked\": \"2026-11-18\"}\n  ]\n}\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":6,"newStart":1,"newLines":6,"lines":[" {","   \"schemaVersion\": 1,","-  \"updated\": \"2026-11-15\",","+  \"updated\": \"2026-11-18\",","   \"currency\": \"AUD\",","   \"other\": {\"fastPerKWh\": 0.65, \"slowPerKWh\": 0.4, \"source\": \"Typical Australian prices for a fast charger and an AC post on a network Charge Line doesn't list (Charge Line's charging price research, 27 October 2026)\"},","   \"networks\": ["]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016TnNSvfdYb3gBJraPHpbPd","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
