{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HqfxPhXDLpaGFCeCoJKEBW","type":"tool_result","content":"[prices/new-networks-2026-11-18 413217b] Prices: add Exploren, WA EV Network, Electrona, WeVolt; widen Chargefox match\n 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00999965-fd79-4ff4-93d0-123f38506fe6","uuid":"96de1b08-d277-44d5-83cd-d1c077b6d84d","timestamp":"2026-11-18T11:09:02.598Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"[prices/new-networks-2026-11-18 413217b] Prices: add Exploren, WA EV Network, Electrona, WeVolt; widen Chargefox match\n 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"gitOperation":{"commit":{"sha":"413217b","kind":"committed","branch":"prices/new-networks-2026-11-18"}}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HqfxPhXDLpaGFCeCoJKEBW","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"subcommandResults"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChAHjB4NDm7dWiwj3bp1G","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YCavnw1kiEykBqb5DVG7Wx","name":"mcp__safeoutputs__create_pull_request","input":{"title":"[prices] Add Exploren, WA EV Network, Electrona, WeVolt; Yurika, RAA, EHT join Chargefox","branch":"prices/new-networks-2026-11-18","body":"Adds four networks and folds four operators into existing ones. Existing typical prices were not changed: I found no evidence that any has moved.\n\n| Change | Old | New | Source and figure |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| New network `waEvNetwork` (matches \"wa ev network\", \"wa ev highway\", \"horizon power\") | n/a | typical 0.60, published | Horizon Power pricing page, as returned by search: DC \"0.60c\" (read as $0.60) and AC 0.35, unchanged for 2026/27. The page refused my fetch (403), so I could not read it directly. Its early FAQs also say $0.60 DC. https://www.horizonpower.com.au/utilities/pricing/ |\n| New network `exploren` (matches \"exploren\", \"engie\"), siteReading `forbidden` | n/a | typical null | Search results from several sites agree Exploren took over Engie's DC network in 2025. Third-party trackers give $0.30–1.04 a kWh, so no typical price. |\n| New network `electrona` | n/a | typical null | One PlugShare listing says Bicheno DC $0.65, which is one site only. |\n| New network `wevolt` | n/a | typical null | Trackers give differing ranges (35–73c). |\n| Chargefox `match` gains \"yurika\", \"queensland electric super highway\" | n/a | n/a | yurika.com.au and a QESH summary say charging is through the Chargefox app. |\n| Chargefox `match` gains \"raa\" | n/a | n/a | RAA's own site (raa.com.au/motor/motoring-services/ev-charging-stations): charge and pay in the Chargefox app. |\n| Chargefox `match` gains \"electric highway tasmania\" | n/a | n/a | Search results say EHT uses Chargefox for billing. |\n\nChargefox's own typical price (0.60) was left as it is.\n\n**Not sure about**\n- \"raa\" is a short substring and could match an unrelated site name. Worth a glance when the app's matching is checked.\n- \"Charging the Regions\" (25 fast sites) looks like a council programme whose sites run through Chargefox or Evie, depending on the site. I left it undecided in memory.\n- Woolworths is recorded as a site owner only.\n- The Electric Highway Tasmania and Yurika/Chargefox links rest on search summaries rather than a page I could open, because the Yurika and RAA pages I tried by guessed URL returned 404.\n- No network's `checked` date is more than six months old, so there is no issue to raise about stale prices.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":210,"cache_read_input_tokens":55305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":210,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":32,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"00999965-fd79-4ff4-93d0-123f38506fe6","uuid":"4f3c935e-2b6b-4659-a063-6b3f1e4ecb47","timestamp":"2026-11-18T11:09:09.785Z","request_id":"req_011ChAHjAkkoNauhKwJYGaMW","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YCavnw1kiEykBqb5DVG7Wx","display_name":"Create Pull Request","server_display_name":"awmg-safeoutputs","tool_name":"create_pull_request"}]}
